# Chester's Imports · Fax Machine

Desk object. Click the plate to cycle **where** you are faxing.
Drop a **leaf** (or card) on it — **copies** out as clean Markdown into that
destination's docks folder. Original stays on the desk.

Foundation destinations live in desk store (`FAX_DESTINATIONS`).
First line: **Port QXA** → `C:\ALICE_REBORN\PORT-QXA\docks\`.
